# 화이트리스트 방식 : 기본적으로 전부 무시하고, 레포에 올릴 파일만 허용한다.
# (데이터 .pkl, .env, 모델 joblib, 개인 PDF/기존 작업물이 올라가지 않도록)
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/stuff_pipeline.py
!/stuff_model.py
!/hof_net.py
!/hofnet_experiment.py
!/hofnet_followup.py
!/hof_net_r.py
!/hofnet_r_experiment.py
!/build_hof_web_model.py
!/model_choice_analysis.py
!/hofnet_diag_experiment.py
!/stuff_pipeline_*.ipynb
!/export_web_data.py
!/compute_shap.py
!/web/
!/업무일지/
!/outputs/
/outputs/*
!/outputs/*.png
!/outputs/*.csv
!/outputs/v2/
/outputs/v2/*
!/outputs/v2/*.png
!/outputs/v2/*.csv
!/outputs/vaa_exp/
/outputs/vaa_exp/*
!/outputs/vaa_exp/*.png
!/outputs/vaa_exp/*.csv
!/outputs/hofnet/
/outputs/hofnet/*
!/outputs/hofnet/*.png
!/outputs/hofnet/*.csv
!/outputs/hofnet/*.json
!/outputs/hofnet/*_log.txt
!/outputs/hofnet_nopt/
/outputs/hofnet_nopt/*
!/outputs/hofnet_nopt/*.csv
!/outputs/hofnet_nopt/*.json
!/outputs/hofnet_nopt/*_log.txt
!/outputs/hofnet_r/
/outputs/hofnet_r/*
!/outputs/hofnet_r/*.csv
!/outputs/hofnet_r/*.json
!/outputs/hofnet_r/*_log.txt
!/outputs/model_choice/
/outputs/model_choice/*
!/outputs/model_choice/*.csv
!/outputs/model_choice/*.json
!/outputs/model_choice/*_log.txt
!/outputs/hofnet_diag/
/outputs/hofnet_diag/*
!/outputs/hofnet_diag/*.csv
!/outputs/hofnet_diag/*_log.txt

# 클라우드 운영 (GitHub Actions + HF 데이터셋 + Vercel)
!/.github/
!/data_store.py
!/ops.py
!/requirements.txt
!/data_status.json
# 모델 : 웹 모델(v3) + 예비(v3_h4) + 직전 웹 모델(v2, 되돌리기용) 추적 (클라우드 배치가 git 의 모델로 점수 계산)
!/models/
/models/*
!/models/v2/
/models/v2/*
!/models/v2/*.joblib
!/models/v3/
/models/v3/*
!/models/v3/*.joblib
!/models/v3/*.json
!/models/v3_h4/
/models/v3_h4/*
!/models/v3_h4/*.joblib
!/models/v3_h4/*.json
!/models/v4/
/models/v4/*
!/models/v4/*.joblib
!/models/v4/*.json
# 대체 웹 모델 HOF-Net-R (웹에서 선택, 클라우드 배치가 점수·근거 계산)
!/models/hof_r/
/models/hof_r/*
!/models/hof_r/*.joblib
!/models/hof_r/*.json
